        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTICE OF END OF LIVE SERVICE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver will no longer be hosted on online servers and will be offline (solo) by<strong> early December</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver will still be available to purchase and will continue to be available to play </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver will no longer receive game updates besides major bug fixes and technical and infrastructure improvements on occasion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players who purchase or purchased Starlight Re:Volver automatically unlock all dekos (cosmetics) ever made by default</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/341b4812a308f1a50777e57a4258c8ea.avif?t=1770059837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras_big/341b4812a308f1a50777e57a4258c8ea.avif?t=1770059837 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/dc371609504feffa2d7f254ed0a8a5d5.avif?t=1770059837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras_big/dc371609504feffa2d7f254ed0a8a5d5.avif?t=1770059837 width=800 height=156 /></span><strong>THANK YOU - TOP 10 MOST PLAYED DEMO OF STEAM NEXT FEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver was #10 in the most-played demos of June 2025's Steam Next Fest 🎊</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To everyone who played our game, got their friends to play, gave us feedback, and joined our community – we are so grateful 💖</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT STARLIGHT RE:VOLVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.poster.avif?t=1770059837\" width=600 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.webm?t=1770059837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.mp4?t=1770059837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Transform. Team up. Dive again and again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver is an action RPG   in a vibrant anime world. Play as magical heroes, fight through dreamlike biomes, and discover new challenges every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>A Living Anime City:</strong> Between expeditions, return to Nishi Island Metropolis to fish, craft, and hoverboard around the city.<br>🌠 <strong>Roguelike Elements:</strong> No two dives are the same. Unlock abilities, swap powers, and experiment with builds to shape your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎏 <strong>Expression &amp; Style:</strong> Collect accessories and show off your unique look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 <strong>Signature Soundtrack:</strong> Immerse yourself in nostalgic J-pop and citypop, featuring Sarah Bonito (Kero Kero Bonito), IRyS, LilyPichu, and more.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTICE OF END OF LIVE SERVICE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver will no longer be hosted on online servers and will be offline (solo) by<strong> early December</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver will still be available to purchase and will continue to be available to play </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver will no longer receive game updates besides major bug fixes and technical and infrastructure improvements on occasion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players who purchase or purchased Starlight Re:Volver automatically unlock all dekos (cosmetics) ever made by default</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/341b4812a308f1a50777e57a4258c8ea.avif?t=1770059837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras_big/341b4812a308f1a50777e57a4258c8ea.avif?t=1770059837 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/dc371609504feffa2d7f254ed0a8a5d5.avif?t=1770059837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras_big/dc371609504feffa2d7f254ed0a8a5d5.avif?t=1770059837 width=800 height=156 /></span><strong>THANK YOU - TOP 10 MOST PLAYED DEMO OF STEAM NEXT FEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver was #10 in the most-played demos of June 2025's Steam Next Fest 🎊</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To everyone who played our game, got their friends to play, gave us feedback, and joined our community – we are so grateful 💖</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT STARLIGHT RE:VOLVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.poster.avif?t=1770059837\" width=600 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.webm?t=1770059837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.mp4?t=1770059837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Transform. Team up. Dive again and again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver is an action RPG   in a vibrant anime world. Play as magical heroes, fight through dreamlike biomes, and discover new challenges every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>A Living Anime City:</strong> Between expeditions, return to Nishi Island Metropolis to fish, craft, and hoverboard around the city.<br>🌠 <strong>Roguelike Elements:</strong> No two dives are the same. Unlock abilities, swap powers, and experiment with builds to shape your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎏 <strong>Expression &amp; Style:</strong> Collect accessories and show off your unique look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 <strong>Signature Soundtrack:</strong> Immerse yourself in nostalgic J-pop and citypop, featuring Sarah Bonito (Kero Kero Bonito), IRyS, LilyPichu, and more.</p>",
